# OOLA Structured Phi lock

- Icons are `viewBox="0 0 24 24"`, `stroke-width="1.5"`, `stroke-linecap/linejoin="round"`, `fill="none"`, `currentColor`.
- Soft ~2–3px corners (no hard-mitered apexes). No organic/wavy/droplet-only shapes.
- φ sizes: primary ~12.4, secondary ~7.6, tertiary ~4.7. Search lens = primary diameter; handle = tertiary.
- Cogs ≤6 teeth; bells need flared lip + clapper; keepers `mail`/`house`/`search` are frozen unless explicitly forced.
- Before accepting any new SVG under `drafts/`, run `npm run qa:icons` and fix failures.
- Do not use OpenRouter/Recraft for scale-up unless outputs pass the same QA.
- Preview Fill on open paths must fall back to Regular outline (no blank cells).
